   * Booting from SD


==== Availability ====

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://www.pcduino.com/pcduino-v3/|here for pcDuino v3]].

Further details on the board: [[http://linux-sunxi.org/LinkSprite_pcDuino_V3]]

